    {
      "text": "Grease a 9- or 10-inch tube pan with softened butter. Sprinkle butterscotch pudding mix and white sugar into the prepared tube pan. Arrange rolls around the pan. Sprinkle with pecans and brown sugar, then drizzle melted butter over the top. Place the pan in a cold oven and allow dough to rise 8 hours to overnight.",
